00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:51.790
Chapter 14 Thoughts

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:51.790
♪ Seven spring herbs, shepherd's purse ♪

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:57.250
♪ Ere do the western birds ♪

00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:02.080
♪ To the lands of the east ♪

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:05.390
Mom... I'm scared!

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:07.000
♪ Come across the sea to roost ♪

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:11.900
Don't go anywhere. Please, Mom...

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:13.520
♪ Seven spring herbs, shepherd's purse ♪

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:19.910
♪ Ere do the western birds ♪

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:25.500
♪ To the lands of the east ♪

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:30.960
♪ Come across the sea to roost ♪

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:34.630
♪ Seven spring herbs, shep... ♪

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:58.370
Mom...

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:11.410
Mom!

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:23.660
<i>Mom...</i>

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:34.440
<i>If that man...</i>

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:40.410
<i>If I ever find out who he is...</i>

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:43.700
Stay just the way you are

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:45.130
<i>I...</i>

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:51.200
I...

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:17.150
But we can't figure out the reason for it.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:22.070
Hey, maybe at fifteen, he's finally
had his first taste of youth!

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:25.360
We've heard that one before.

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:29.700
So that's why Mr. Yamanami's agitated.

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:31.250
What do you mean?

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:33.930
You'd never understand,
not in a million years.

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:35.040
What'd you say?!

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:39.540
How about it, Tatsunosuke?
You really don't know why?

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:44.220
Oh, please don't worry.
It really isn't a big deal.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:47.910
In the end, a lot happened at Shimabara.

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:50.950
What?! I haven't heard about this, Heisuke!

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:55.620
Well, I can't really say in
front of the big brother.

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:57.900
But I was there at Shimabara, too.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.820
Oh, is that right?

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:05.570
Well, we'd better get going.

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:08.870
Sano, Heisuke, come on, let's go.

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:11.040
We haven't finished talking yet.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.910
It doesn't matter.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.830
Oh, good sirs.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:21.080
Might I ask you not to toy with my younger
brother in the future, to the extent possible?

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:25.840
With the Shimabara incident,
my stomach and my patience

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.840
were both pushed to their utmost limit.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:30.970
I most sincerely ask this of you.

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:34.680
Yes, sir! We'll keep that firmly in mind!

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:54.540
<i>I have to hurry...</i>

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.290
<i>and make him forget about it.</i>

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:14.310
May I help you?

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:21.620
That's no good. That is not
a Tatsunosuke reaction.

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:23.570
Really?

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:32.620
I wonder just what's
going through that mind?

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:36.330
Well, in spite of it all,
he <i>is</i> hitting puberty.

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:38.540
It's like a bad habit of sorts.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.040
By tomorrow, I'm sure...

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:44.460
No, I didn't mean Tetsu, but you.

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:49.510
Was my expression just
now really that strange?

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:55.370
Well, to be honest, it's not so
much about what you're thinking,

00:06:55.370 --> 00:07:01.560
but more about what you've seen,
for even you to show it on your face.

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:03.280
That's what bothers me.

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:09.450
What Tetsu's seen,
as well as what you've seen.

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:11.740
Mr. Okita...

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:15.540
Curiosity is a fine thing,

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:20.660
but could I ask you not to ask Tetsu
about yesterday when he gets up?

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:23.080
Because, well, how should I put this?

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:26.920
It involved nothing but a
lot of bad influences.

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:31.090
Is that why you're trying
to forget about it?

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:33.590
Is that so wrong?

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:38.220
But I doubt Tetsu will forget.

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:41.410
Are you sure about this?

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:44.450
While you're trying to forget,

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:47.070
he may go find out for himself.

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:51.700
Just who it was that killed his parents...

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.740
You're incorrigible.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:02.920
If you know all that, I'll
get right to the point.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:06.250
This is a problem between
my younger brother and myself.

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:10.420
We don't need anyone interfering.
Not even you, Mr. Okita.

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:13.250
I'm sorry.

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:16.930
If I've offended you, I'm sorry.

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:19.000
But...

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:23.620
But what befell all of you

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:28.160
is far too big to keep tucked
away in your heart alone.

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:33.500
This may sound cold-hearted,

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:36.450
but I have no intention of
commiserating with him,

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:40.700
much less avenging their deaths with him.

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:50.340
A life with no kin has given me
an awfully constructive personality.

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:56.790
Well, to be honest, rather than
bemoaning the tragedy of yesterday,

00:08:56.790 --> 00:09:00.350
my days were spent worrying
about being able to eat tomorrow.

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:05.560
I was thinking only about money,
rather than my parents.

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:10.080
I'm really such a thankless son, aren't I?

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:18.410
And about the only thing
such a son could do for them

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:23.050
was to live well and raise Tetsu
to become a respectable adult.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.480
That tickles!

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:36.930
Even though I have no idea what
Tetsu was thinking during that time.

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:42.540
I think that's more than enough to
allow your parents to rest in peace.

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:46.590
I have no choice but to make him forget.

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:50.650
If I'm to keep him out of
harm's way from now on,

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:54.150
I have no choice but to make him forget.

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:57.150
And yet...

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:00.870
And yet...

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:05.710
What was with that man?!

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:28.980
<i>And you think you're a spy?
We know everything about you.</i>

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:33.340
<i>Shinsengumi watcher, Susumu Yamazaki.</i>

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:39.500
Nothing would be more dangerous
than infiltrating Masuya now.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:42.200
And besides, if "Sen" is no good,

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:44.670
"Yumi the hairdresser" can take action.

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:45.990
Yes, sir.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.010
There is no need for you to fret.

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:59.380
I have failed the samurai's code.

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:13.870
Don't you get the wrong idea.

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:15.770
You're not a samurai.

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:26.950
Do you mean to let Mr. Hijikata's
sentiments go for nothing?

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:31.710
Mr. Hijikata's placed his
trust in you, you know.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:35.160
And you're going to just ditch
that and commit seppuku?

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:36.970
Could you be any more wretched?!

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:44.080
If you're gonna die anyway,
do a hundred, two hundred jobs,

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:47.060
and then you can die, once you've
fully expended your life as a man.

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:50.830
Don't you get the wrong idea.

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:52.400
You're a spy.

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:12.460
Why aren't I allowed to
make steady progress?

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:15.950
Why is there always
something getting in my way?

00:12:15.950 --> 00:12:18.960
And that Tetsu's part of the problem!

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:21.470
He has no idea what I go through.

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:24.510
He even tagged along with
me into the Shinsengumi!

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:27.560
So what if you become strong?

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:30.560
How is that going to change anything?!

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:35.120
So you get your revenge.

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:37.610
So you become strong enough to do that.

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:41.740
So you have that strength...

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:51.830
I'm sorry. It seems some tea
went down the wrong way.

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:53.750
Well...

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:58.700
Pardon me, I just realized
I've been babbling on and on.

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:01.420
Please allow me to ask you one thing.

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:10.120
Are emotional scars so easily healed?

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:13.560
At the very least...

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:18.890
I believe that I'm healed.

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:25.560
<i>Is he your pawn as well?</i>

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:31.960
<i>You'd rather not make the same
mistake that you did with me.</i>

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:39.330
How unusual for you.

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:46.130
Your color is off.

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:50.620
I was born looking like this.
What are you doing here?

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:53.520
Don't you need to be
getting dinner ready soon?

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:57.660
Well, I will be taking a break
from that work for a while,

00:13:57.660 --> 00:14:00.020
since I will have some
work in my true trade.

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:08.400
I have come for my assignment.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:13.330
Hey, Tetsu!

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:14.910
It's time to eat!

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:18.290
It's Ayu's cooking!

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:24.000
You know how busy she is, and she
worked hard to make this dinner!

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:25.290
N't want it.

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:27.420
What did you say, little puppy boy?

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:29.840
I don't want it!

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:32.940
Sheesh!

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:40.140
Saya...

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:48.650
Look, for that part,

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:51.200
this is how you play it.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:03.340
Let's see, I've got 19 cards.

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:06.040
And you've got 29?

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:08.410
Man, so it's an overwhelming
victory for Saya?

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:10.940
Osaya?

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:14.510
What's the matter?

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:24.830
From the look on your face, I'd say you
were thinking about someone you fancy.

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:29.680
So which do you like?

00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:31.330
The taller one?

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:34.570
Or the little energetic one?

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:38.290
Oh, it's the little
energetic one, isn't it?

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:42.680
It's okay.

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:48.580
You mustn't let being a woman of
the red-light district hold you back.

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:51.300
You have to love him with all your might.

00:15:52.290 --> 00:15:54.660
Your station in life doesn't matter.

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:57.750
Where you were born and how
you were raised don't matter.

00:15:57.750 --> 00:16:01.520
It's okay for you to
live true to your heart.

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:03.440
Be true...

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:12.110
You mean, he hasn't had a thing
to eat the whole entire day?

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:16.700
It seems more like he's grappling with
something, rather than not feeling well.

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:19.700
We told him you were cooking
for the first time in a long while,

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:22.200
but he said he didn't want any.

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:26.040
Anyone who laughs at Ayu's cooking will
be crying later because they missed it!

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:29.580
So my dinner's gonna be a
super-special big serving!

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:31.050
Hey, no fair!

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:35.090
No!!

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:42.830
But Ayu, as they say, "Those
who miss mealtimes don't eat."

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:45.580
What's gotten into you today?

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:48.410
Well, that is...

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:51.190
Showing Tetsu some special
consideration, are we?

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:52.450
Oh, goodness!

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:55.080
Could it be that you
actually like them young?

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:57.700
Oh, whatever. We can leave it at that.

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:00.910
Tonight's dinner's gonna be a masterpiece.

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:07.450
So I want everyone to eat
it together, friendly-like.

00:17:07.450 --> 00:17:08.170
You know?

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:13.870
I'm hungry.

00:17:13.870 --> 00:17:16.430
I better get off my butt and eat something.

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:23.480
<i>Suzu...</i>

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:34.080
<i>I'll find him for sure,
and ask him about it all.</i>

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:38.360
<i>Even if it might totally
ruin our friendship.</i>

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:42.200
<i>I have to find out.</i>

00:17:58.540 --> 00:17:59.680
<i>That woman...</i>

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:04.510
<i>Yamazaki...</i>

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:08.380
Yamazaki!

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:23.120
Tetsunosuke...

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:30.420
No, it was nothing.

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:34.090
Oh, no, no. Hold on!

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:36.170
Ta-da!

00:18:37.910 --> 00:18:39.510
Ayu!

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:45.120
No, you guys totally look alike!

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:48.410
Of course, he's got tons of makeup
on because his is a disguise.

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:49.750
What's with that?

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:53.110
You aren't gonna tell me that
I'm more of a doll than he is?

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:54.450
I get it!

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:59.700
He paints his face up to look
like you when he's in disguise!

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:03.950
By the way, you've been
going out a lot lately.

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:05.700
Hold it.

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:08.870
If it's questions, I get to go first.

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:10.500
What was with you today?

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:12.830
You didn't even have dinner.

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:14.750
What does it matter?

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:17.510
I'm not a kid anymore, you know.

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:21.010
I've got a thing or two on my mind.

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:23.500
So I guess what you're telling me

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:26.640
is that I didn't need to feel sorry
for a respectable grown man

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:31.640
and carefully save some dinner for him?

00:19:31.640 --> 00:19:33.700
Really, you must pardon me!

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:36.620
Well, a cold meal's nothing
worth eating anyway.

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:38.250
Guess I'll go feed it to some stray.

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:40.240
Oh, no... I'm sorry!

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:43.820
Please let me have it!

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:50.450
It's so great that you
can say what you mean.

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:52.710
I envy your big brother.

00:19:53.950 --> 00:19:57.580
You know, Tetsunosuke, for my part,

00:19:57.580 --> 00:20:02.180
I don't want you thinking too much about
complicated things at such a young age.

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:06.660
If it's something where
you've got a couple of choices,

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:09.750
you just have to be honest
with yourself and act on that.

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:12.770
Otherwise, it's such a waste
of your energetic personality.

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:13.800
Right?

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:17.440
What's so funny?

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:22.330
You really are like a big
sister, you know that?

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:34.120
Sis, when I grow up,

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:36.640
will I get to be a spy just like you?

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:42.250
Ayu...

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:47.920
Please, Tetsunosuke...

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:53.960
Even if it's just a little,
be friends with him for me.

00:20:55.450 --> 00:21:00.040
Having fights with him
and comforting him...

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:02.360
Because I'm sure you're
the only one who can do that.

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:07.660
And teach him lots...

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:10.950
About how to enjoy life...

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:13.700
About how to be happy...

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:15.000
About how to have fun...

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:27.340
Teach him lots and lots about
all those things in my place.

